      "claim": "Human CSF pharmacokinetic data for a related CNS-penetrant molecule showed adequate central nervous system entry, reinforcing that this general scaffold class can achieve meaningful CNS exposure in humans.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
